 "intro": {
  "@es": "Cuando algo no pasó y te arrepientes o lo comentas, usas el tipo III: «si lo hubiera sabido, habría llamado». Es la forma de hablar de lo que pudo ser y no fue.",
  "@en": "When something didn't happen and you regret it or you say it, you use type III: «If I had known, I would have called.». It's the way to talk about what it could be and it wasn't."
 }
